# NVIDIA RTX DLSS 4, Ray Reconstruction, NRD & Streamline (`nvidia-rtx-dlss-rr-nrd-streamline`)

Governs the integration, auditing, and optimization of **NVIDIA NGX, Streamline SDK, DLSS 4 Super Resolution / DLAA (Transformer Presets `J/K/L/M`), DLSS-D Ray Reconstruction (`nvngx_dlssd.dll`), NVIDIA Real-Time Denoisers (NRD `REBLUR`/`RELAX`), and NVIDIA Reflex** across DirectX 11 (`OGSR-Engine`), DirectX 12, and Vulkan renderers.

